{"product_id":"aaa","title":"Scarlet Regent – Handcrafted Custom Pool Cue | Cues Master","description":"\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eBold, elegant, and crafted with a distinctive sense of luxury, the \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eScarlet Regent\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e is a handcrafted custom pool cue that brings together the natural character of \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003epremium ashwood\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e with rich rosewood, handcrafted abalone, and vibrant multi-colored veneers.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThe \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003epremium ashwood forearm\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e provides a warm and naturally dramatic foundation, showcasing its distinctive grain while framing striking \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003erosewood and abalone inlays\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e. Carefully layered \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003emulti-colored veneers\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e surround the inlay work, creating rich contrast and visual depth while emphasizing the precision of the handcrafted design.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThe centerpiece continues through the handle with a luxurious \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003ered crocodile wrap\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e, adding rich texture, a confident grip, and a bold crimson accent against the natural ashwood. The deep red character of the wrap creates a powerful visual connection with the warm tones of the rosewood and multi-colored veneers.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eMeticulously crafted \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eabalone rings\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e add subtle flashes of natural iridescence throughout the cue, complementing the inlay work and providing an elegant finishing detail. The combination of natural ashwood, rich red accents, and intricate detailing creates a design that feels both classic and distinctive.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"isSelectedEnd\"\u003e\u003cspan\u003eCreated for discerning players and collectors, the \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eScarlet Regent\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e combines \u003c\/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003epremium ashwood, rosewood, intricate inlay work, layered veneers, natural abalone, and luxury materials\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e into a truly commanding custom cue. Every element is carefully balanced to create a piece that stands apart through craftsmanship and character.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch3\u003e\u003cspan\u003eSpecifications\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eWood:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Premium Ashwood\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eInlays:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Handcrafted Rosewood \u0026amp; Abalone Inlays\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eVeneers:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Custom Multi-Colored Veneers\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eWrap:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Premium Red Crocodile Wrap\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003e\u003cspan\u003eRings:\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan\u003e Handcrafted Abalone Rings\u003c\/span\u003e\n\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u00